	(text "Each control position is fitted per effect with a pot or a button: exactly one fit is placed per position.\nBoth fits are drawn (CR-PEDAL-POPULATION, variant positions; CR-PEDAL-CONTROL-NODE; open row CONTROL-POSITION-VARIANTS).\n- POS4: pot fit RV4; button fit SW4 with its pull-up R61; always fitted R62, R63, C52.\n- POS5: pot fit RV5; button fit SW5 with its pull-up R64; always fitted R65, R66, C53.\n- POS6: pot fit RV6; button fit SW6 with its pull-up R67; always fitted R68, R69, C54." (at 27.94 166.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "62226a3a-3274-55b7-a40e-1b378bb77fd3"))
